# A test double of Qt WebEngine's QML module (the host has no Qt WebEngine):
# the names Keel's WebEngineBackend.qml uses, as Qt 6.4's QtWebEngine
# plugins.qmltypes declares them. It renders nothing; tests drive it.
module QtWebEngine
WebEngineView 1.10 WebEngineView.qml
WebEngineProfile 1.10 WebEngineProfile.qml
WebEngineSettings 1.10 WebEngineSettings.qml
WebEngineLoadingInfo 1.10 WebEngineLoadingInfo.qml
WebEngineNavigationRequest 1.10 WebEngineNavigationRequest.qml
JavaScriptDialogRequest 1.10 JavaScriptDialogRequest.qml
AuthenticationDialogRequest 1.10 AuthenticationDialogRequest.qml
ContextMenuRequest 1.10 ContextMenuRequest.qml
FileDialogRequest 1.10 FileDialogRequest.qml
ColorDialogRequest 1.10 ColorDialogRequest.qml
singleton FakeLog 1.10 FakeLog.qml
